# AWS Database Migration Service User Guide

> Migrate databases to AWS easily and securely using AWS Database Migration Service (AWS DMS) with this User Guide.

- [What is AWS Database Migration Service?](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/Welcome.md)
- [AWS zero-ETL integration for self-managed database sources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/zero-etl.md)
- [Best practices](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_BestPractices.md)
- [Working with EventBridge events](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_EventBridge.md)
- [Working with Amazon SNS events](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Events.md)
- [Tagging resources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Tagging.md)
- [Limits](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Limits.md)
- [Release notes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_ReleaseNotes.md)
- [Document history](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/WhatsNew.md)
- [AWS Glossary](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/glossary.md)

## [Terminology and concepts](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Introduction.md)

- [High-level view of AWS DMS](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Introduction.HighLevelView.md): Get a high-level view of AWS DMS.
- [Components](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Introduction.Components.md): This section describes the internal components of AWS DMS and how they function together to accomplish your data migration.
- [Sources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Introduction.Sources.md): Use the listed data stores as sources for different AWS DMS features.
- [Targets](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Introduction.Targets.md): Use the listed data stores as target endpoints for data migration using AWS DMS.
- [Amazon Resource Names](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Introduction.AWS.ARN.md): Create Amazon Resource Names (ARNs) for use with AWS DMS.
- [With other AWS services](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_Introduction.AWS.md): Use AWS DMS with other AWS services.


## [Getting started](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_GettingStarted.md)

- [Set up](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_GettingStarted.SettingUp.md): Set up for AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Prerequisites](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_GettingStarted.Prerequisites.md): Perform prerequisite tasks for AWS Database Migration Service such as setting up your source and target databases.
- [Migrate schema](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_GettingStarted.SCT.md): We recommend using DMS Schema Conversion to convert your source database schemas.
- [Replication](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_GettingStarted.Replication.md): In this topic, you set up replication between the source and target databases.


## [AWS DMS Fleet Advisor end of support](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dms_fleet.advisor-end-of-support.md)

- [Discovering databases for migration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_FleetAdvisor.md)
- [Understand DMS Fleet Advisor](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-getting-started.md): Learn how you can get started with DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Creating required resources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-resources.md): Create required AWS resources for DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Creating database users](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-database-users.md): Create database users with minimum privileges for AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.

### [Data collectors](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-data-collectors.md)

Learn how to use AWS DMS Fleet Advisor to discover databases for migration using AWS DMS data collectors.

- [Creating a data collector](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-data-collectors-create.md): How to create a data collector for DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Installing a data collector](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-data-collectors-install.md): How to install a data collector for DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Discovering OS and database servers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-discovery.md): Use your on-premises DMS data collector to find and list all available servers in your network that you can monitor.
- [Managing monitored objects](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-managing-objects.md): Manually manage monitored objects such as operating system (OS) servers and database servers.
- [Using SSL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-using-ssl.md): How to use SSL with AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Collecting data](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-collecting.md): Start collecting data for AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.

### [Troubleshooting](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-collectors-troubleshooting.md)

Find actions that you can take when you encounter issues while collecting data with the DMS data collector.

- [Network and server connection related issues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-collectors-troubleshooting-net.md): Find actions that you can take when you encounter issues related to network and server connections with the DMS data collector.
- [WMI related issues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-collectors-troubleshooting-wmi.md): Find actions that you can take when you encounter issues related to Windows Management Instrumentation with the DMS data collector.
- [WPC related issues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-collectors-troubleshooting-wpc.md): Find actions that you can take when you encounter issues related to Windows webpage composer with the DMS data collector.
- [SSL related issues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-collectors-troubleshooting-ssl.md): Find actions that you can take when you encounter issues related to SSL with the DMS data collector.

### [Inventory](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-inventory.md)

Work with inventories of discovered databases and schemas to check the feasibility of potential database migrations.

- [Using the database inventory](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-inventory-database.md): Learn how to view the inventory of your databases in AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Using the schema inventory](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-inventory-schema.md): Learn how to view the inventory of your database schemas in AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.

### [Target recommendations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-recommendations.md)

Generate, view, and save a local copy of the target recommendations for your source databases.

- [Generating target recommendations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-recommendations-generate.md): Learn how to generate target recommendations with AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Recommendation details](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-recommendations-view.md): Learn how to explore details of your target recommendations with AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Exporting target recommendations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-recommendations-export.md): Learn how to save a copy of your target recommendations with AWS DMS Fleet Advisor.
- [Migration limitations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-data-collectors-database-features.md): Learn more about database features that DMS Fleet Advisor collects.
- [Troubleshooting](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-recommendations-troubleshooting.md): Learn more about actions to take when you encounter issues with the AWS DMS Fleet Advisor Target Recommendations feature.
- [Limitations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/fa-welcome-limitations.md): Learn about the limitations of the DMS Fleet Advisor.


## [Converting database schemas](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/CHAP_SchemaConversion.md)

### [Getting started](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started.md)

Use this tutorial to get started with DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

- [Prerequisites](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/set-up.md): Set up the AWS resources that DMS Schema Conversion requires, including network connectivity, storage, database credentials, and IAM permissions, before you create a migration project.
- [Create an instance profile](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started-instance.md): Learn how to create an instance profile for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Create data providers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started-data-providers.md): Learn how to create data providers in DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Create a migration project](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started-project.md): Learn how to create a migration project in DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Create an assessment report](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started-assessment.md): Learn how to create an assessment report in DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Convert your source code](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started-convert.md): Learn how to convert your source database storage and code objects in DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Apply the converted code](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started-apply.md): Learn how to apply your converted code to the target data provider for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Clean up and troubleshoot](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/getting-started-clean-up.md): Learn how to stop your migration project and find log information for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

### [Concepts](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-concepts.md)

Learn about the concepts for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

- [Metadata model](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-metadata-model.md): Learn about the metadata model in DMS Schema Conversion.
- [Selection rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-selection-rules.md): A selection rule specifies which database objects a DMS Schema Conversion operation acts on.
- [Transformation rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-transformation-rules.md): Describes how transformation rules customize the conversion of database objects (metadata models) such as schemas, tables, columns, and routines.

### [Default conversion rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-conversion-rules.md)

Describes the default conversion rules that DMS Schema Conversion applies in every migration project.

### [Oracle to PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-oracle.md)

Learn the default rules that DMS Schema Conversion applies when it converts an Oracle source to Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL or Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL, covering object types, naming, data types, and built-in functions and system objects.

- [Object type rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-object-types-oracle.md): The following table lists how DMS Schema Conversion converts Oracle object types to PostgreSQL.
- [Naming rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-naming-oracle.md): The following naming rules apply when your source database is Oracle.
- [Data type rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-data-types-oracle.md): The following rules apply when you convert an Oracle database to Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL or Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL.
- [Built-in function and system object rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-builtins-oracle.md): Learn how DMS Schema Conversion converts Oracle built-in functions, packages, procedures, and system objects to Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL and Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL.

### [SQL Server to PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-sqlserver.md)

Learn the default rules that DMS Schema Conversion applies when it converts a Microsoft SQL Server source to Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL or Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL, covering object types, naming, data types, and built-in functions and system objects.

- [Object type rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-object-types-sqlserver.md): The following table lists how DMS Schema Conversion converts SQL Server object types to PostgreSQL.
- [Naming rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-naming-sqlserver.md): The following naming rules apply when your source database is Microsoft SQL Server.
- [Data type rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-data-types-sqlserver.md): The following rules apply when you convert a Microsoft SQL Server database to Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL or Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL.
- [Built-in function and system object rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-default-rules-builtins-sqlserver.md): Learn how DMS Schema Conversion converts Microsoft SQL Server built-in functions and system objects to PostgreSQL and Aurora PostgreSQL.
- [Setting up a network](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/instance-profiles-network.md): Learn how to set up a network for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

### [Creating source data providers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-source.md)

Learn how to create source data providers for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

- [Using SQL Server as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-sql-server.md): Learn how to use a SQL Server database as a source for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using Oracle as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-oracle.md): Learn how to use an Oracle database as a source for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using Oracle Data Warehouse as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-oracle-dw.md): Learn how to use an Oracle Data Warehouse database as a source for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using PostgreSQL as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-data-providers-postgresql.md): Learn how to use a PostgreSQL database as a source for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using MySQL as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-data-providers-mysql.md): Learn how to use a MySQL database as a source for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using Db2 for Linux, UNIX and Windows as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-data-providers-db2luw.md): Learn how to use a Db2 for Linux, UNIX and Windows database as a source for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using Db2 for z/OS as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-data-providers-db2zos.md): Learn how to use a DB2 for z/OS database as a source for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using a SAP ASE (Sybase ASE) database](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-source-sybase-ASE.md): Learn how to use a SAP ASE (Sybase ASE) database as a source in DMS Schema Conversion.

### [Creating and setting target data providers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-target.md)

Learn how to create and set target data providers for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

- [Using MySQL as a target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-mysql.md): Learn how use a MySQL database as a target in for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using PostgreSQL as a target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-postgresql.md): Learn how to use a PostgreSQL database as a target for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using Amazon Redshift as a target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-providers-redshift.md): Learn how to use an Amazon Redshift cluster as a target for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using Amazon RDS for Db2 database as a target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-data-providers-rds.md): You can use Amazon RDS for Db2 databases as a migration target in DMS Schema Conversion.
- [Virtual mode for offline source and virtual target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/virtual-data-provider.md): Learn how to use virtual mode for data providers in AWS DMS Schema Conversion.
- [Managing migration projects](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-migration-projects.md): Learn how to create and manage a migration project for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

### [Conversion assessment reports](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/assessment-reports.md)

Learn about conversion assessment reports generated by DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

- [Understanding report metrics](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/assessment-reports-understanding.md): Learn how to interpret the metrics in your conversion assessment report for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service, including complexity categories, effort estimates, action item codes, and conversion statistics, so that you can accurately assess the scope of your database migration.
- [Migration planning](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/assessment-reports-planning.md): Learn how to use your conversion assessment report to plan a database migration with DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

### [Schema conversion](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion.md)

Convert database schemas by using DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.

- [Converting your database schema: step-by-step guide](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-convert.md): Convert your source schema to an equivalent schema for your target DB instance for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Converting database objects with generative AI](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-convert.databaseobjects.md): The DMS Schema Conversion with generative AI feature streamlines the database migration process by offering recommendations to help you convert previously unconverted code objects that typically require complex manual conversion.

### [Specifying schema conversion settings](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-settings.md)

Configure schema conversion settings for a DMS Schema Conversion migration project using the AWS Management Console or the AWS Database Migration Service API.

- [Oracle to MySQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-oracle-mysql.md): Configure Oracle to MySQL conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Oracle to PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-oracle-postgresql.md): Configure Oracle to PostgreSQL conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Oracle to Amazon Redshift](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-oracle-redshift.md): Configure Oracle to Amazon Redshift conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [SQL Server to MySQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-sql-server-mysql.md): Configure Microsoft SQL Server to MySQL conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [SQL Server to PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-sql-server-postgresql.md): Configure Microsoft SQL Server to PostgreSQL conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [MySQL to PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-mysql-postgresql.md): Review the conversion settings that apply when you convert a MySQL source to Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS) for PostgreSQL or Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL with DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [PostgreSQL to MySQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-postgresql-mysql.md): Review the conversion settings that apply when you convert a PostgreSQL source to Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS) for MySQL or Amazon Aurora MySQL with DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [IBM Db2 for LUW to Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-db2-luw-postgresql.md): Configure IBM Db2 for Linux, UNIX, and Windows (LUW) to Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS) for PostgreSQL conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [IBM Db2 for z/OS to Amazon RDS for Db2](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-db2-zos-db2.md): Configure IBM Db2 for z/OS to Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS) for Db2 conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [IBM Db2 for z/OS to Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-db2-zos-postgresql.md): Configure IBM Db2 for z/OS to PostgreSQL conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [SAP ASE (Sybase ASE) to PostgreSQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-sybase-ase.md): Configure SAP ASE (Sybase ASE) to PostgreSQL conversion settings for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Refreshing your database schemas](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-refresh.md): Learn how you can refresh your source and target database schemas for your DMS Schema Conversion project in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Saving and applying your schema](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-save-apply.md): Save your converted code as SQL scripts and apply it to your target database for DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Converting embedded SQL in Java applications](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/schema-conversion-embedded-sql.md): When you use AWS DMS and DMS Schema Conversion to migrate a database, you might need to convert the embedded SQL in your application to be compatible with your target database.
- [AI agents](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/sc-genai-agents.md): This topic explains how to use AI agents to automate DMS Schema Conversion tasks.
- [Using extension packs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/extension-pack.md): Use extension packs with DMS Schema Conversion in AWS Database Migration Service to emulate source database functions in your target database.


## [Homogeneous data migrations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/data-migrations.md)

- [Overview](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-getting-started.md): Learn how you can get started with homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS.

### [Setting up](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-prerequisites.md)

Learn how to configure required resources for homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS and set up a network for your data migration.

- [Creating IAM resources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-iam-resources.md): Create required IAM resources for homogeneous data migrations.
- [Setting up a network](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-network.md): Learn how to set up a network for homogeneous data migrations.
- [VPC peering network configurations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/vpc-peering.md): With AWS DMS, you can create a serverless environment for homogeneous data migrations in a virtual private cloud (VPC) based on the Amazon VPC service.

### [Creating source data providers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-source.md)

Learn how to create source data providers for homogeneous data migrations in AWS Database Migration Service.

- [Using MySQL or MariaDB as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-source-mysql.md): Learn how use a MySQL-compatible database as a source in for homogeneous data migrations in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using PostgreSQL as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-source-postgresql.md): Learn how to configure your source PostgreSQL database to use it for homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS.
- [Using MongoDB or Amazon DocumentDB as a source](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-source-mongodb.md): Learn how to configure your source MongoDB database to use it for homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS.

### [Create and set a target database](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-target.md)

Learn how to create and set a target database to work with AWS DMS schema conversion

- [Using MySQL or MariaDB as a target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-target-mysql.md): Learn how use a MySQL database as a target for homogeneous data migrations in AWS Database Migration Service.
- [Using PostgreSQL as a target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-target-postgresql.md): Learn how to configure your target PostgreSQL database to use it for homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS.
- [Using Amazon DocumentDB as a target](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-data-providers-target-docdb.md): Learn how to configure your target Amazon DocumentDB database to use it for homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS.

### [Migrating data](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-migrating-data.md)

Learn how you can run homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS.

- [Creating a data migration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-migrating-data-create.md): Learn how you can create a data migration in AWS DMS.
- [Selection rules](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-migrating-data-selectionrules.md): Learn how you can selectively migrate data in a data migration in AWS DMS.
- [Managing data migrations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-migrating-data-manage.md): Learn how you can start, modify, or delete a data migration in AWS DMS.
- [Monitoring data migrations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-migrating-data-monitoring.md): Learn how you can configure and use different monitoring options for data migration in AWS DMS.
- [Migration statuses](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-migrating-data-statuses.md): Understand the statuses of homogeneous data migrations.
- [Migrating data from MySQL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/dms/latest/userguide/dm-migrating-data-mysql.md): Learn how to migrate data from MySQL databases with homogeneous data migrations in AWS DMS.
